    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{2}{15}$, assuming the events are independent.",
      "worked": "Assuming the two shots are independent:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{I do not score})&=1-\\frac{2}{3}\\\\P(\\text{I do not score})&=\\frac{1}{3}\\\\P(\\text{sister does not score})&=1-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\P(\\text{sister does not score})&=\\frac{2}{5}\\\\P(\\text{neither scores})&=\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{2}{5}\\\\P(\\text{neither scores})&=\\frac{2}{15}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
